fallout-ce-3ds
==============

This repository contains modified versions of:

  - fallout1-ce  (https://github.com/alexbatalov/fallout1-ce), by Alexander Batalov,
    via the Nintendo 3DS port by MrHuu (https://github.com/MrHuu/fallout1-ce-3ds)
  - fallout2-ce  (https://github.com/alexbatalov/fallout2-ce), by Alexander Batalov,
    via the Nintendo 3DS port by Deenyoro (https://github.com/Deenyoro/fallout2-ce-3ds)

Modified in 2026-10 for the New Nintendo 3DS. Changes made in this fork include:
a dual-screen layout (game on the touchscreen, information dashboard on the top
screen), Circle Pad walking, tap-to-act and tap-to-move-items controls, hardware
shortcuts for HUD buttons, a built-in manual, save/load and movie-playback fixes,
faster SD-card file access, a Docker build script, and new original icons,
banners and touchscreen frame artwork replacing the upstream images. The full
list is in README.md and the git history.

